{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_title", "source_sha256": "495cfcce8d545d4bb0211133ffbff6e425b12403eb2e6273e30ee744c43f37b7", "ja": "級友と笑う乙女たち", "zh": "与同窗欢笑的少女们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b8aadc0fd7c8e5fbe59d23bf0308ecc166e0bbb53954cb33b63a9e8a43523ad2", "ja": "昴達に昼食に誘われるが、約束があると\n断る育。残念だけど、育が海美と仲良く\nなれた事を心から喜ぶ星梨花、ひなた。\n久しぶりにそろった3人の姉妹は、\n今しかないひとときを謳歌するのだった。", "zh": "昴等人邀育一起吃午饭，但育以有约在身为由婉拒。星梨花和日向虽然遗憾，却由衷地为育能与海美成为好友而感到高兴。久违地聚齐的3姐妹，尽情享受着这段只属于此刻的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1000_null", "source_sha256": "00ab8fe0c7de70e4a02fadaef6e87a1bfb88618646d568d213836cff61ecc668", "ja": "ある日……", "zh": "某一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "871716f5912980af79c6a15241dab0c5a8f3949b9029397977920ff374071201", "ja": "育、ひなた！　今からお昼？\n一緒に食べよう！", "zh": "育、日向！现在去吃午饭吗？一起吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "452a363283d100297845b60cfab2f09c4b0a2c56bb54cb856aaa4202315d090c", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい、昴さん。今日はお姉ちゃ……\nじゃなかった、お姉さまたちと約束してるんだ！", "zh": "啊，抱歉，昴姐姐。今天要和姐姐们……\n不对，是和姐姐们约好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "7547f7a73694c635f2be77f4b6457a94ea4a6fddd13aa12b656be076afcdcb5b", "ja": "先約があるんですね。残念ですけど、育ちゃんが\nみなさんと仲良くなれて、本当によかったです！", "zh": "原来你已经有约了啊。虽然有点遗憾，但小育能和大家成为好朋友，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "7cc04757ce7285d0f309c4541d27d5f5aaa60372a6f66fb208c1517dd74356f5", "ja": "えへへ……みんなのおかげだよ、ありがとう！\nそれじゃあわたし、行ってくるね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……多亏了大家，谢谢你们！\n那我就先走啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "e8395d2256c2a89f0ef1e1d05fa157deb8d0c5cbfd81e88391c84e89bc033826", "ja": "育ちゃん、すっかりこの学校に馴染んで\nくれたみたいですね。よかった♪", "zh": "育好像已经完全适应这所学校了。太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "c65100f11d9aad00cca9186984beba6b9b8774147b2e477109a859edd23e2ba9", "ja": "本当によかったよぉ。……あれ？\nあそこにいるのって、昴さんのお姉さまじゃないかい？", "zh": "真的太好了呀。……咦？在那里的是不是昴小姐的姐姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "9dd83a45086c1668b8901500c65b549c1823617eb1e8dd62efeb1b0227ff09db", "ja": "あっ、本当だ！\n……わたし、ちょっと行ってくる！", "zh": "啊，真的耶！\n……我过去一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "1dc96b50da578d053e855e97d5c7283332b3f971a02848bdb233d6119fb8b028", "ja": "お姉さま……！", "zh": "姐姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2000_030iku", "source_sha256": "8f446e5b07f236cd84319d6e24c3344589e5966fcecede82672f60a9468a7426", "ja": "それでね！　海美さんにバトンが渡ったら、一気に\n他の人を抜いて1位をとっちゃったの。すごいよね♪", "zh": "然后啊！一棒传给海美姐姐之后，她一口气\n超过了其他人拿到第1名呢。好厉害对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "8b356d966e65d2b57c4c154b63a086938250f68e355c8ae55c95a63e5e9fd67d", "ja": "べ、別に……あんなの、たいしたことじゃないわ。\nそれより育、あなた授業中によそ見をしていたの？", "zh": "没、没什么啦……那种程度，根本不算什么啦。\n比起这个，育，你上课的时候东张西望了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "ae7ffd297bc6931fbc7e8b5a217e4d5dea6771c623a40ad014d941374ab5441a", "ja": "だって、すごくカッコよかったし……海美さんの活躍、\nあずさお姉ちゃんにも聞いてもらわなくちゃって！", "zh": "因为真的很帅嘛……而且海美姐姐那么活跃的表现，\n我也一定要讲给梓姐姐听才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2003_010azu", "source_sha256": "ba3babaab849529433f7a5651abd8c22f8ef40e98691abe9ed2610dbaa33573b", "ja": "ふふ……。育ちゃん。とっても素敵なお話だけど、\nもうひとつ気をつけなくちゃいけないことがあるわ。", "zh": "呵呵……育。这番话真的很棒，\n但还有一点是你必须注意的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2004_010azu", "source_sha256": "0ac2e447116d1d195c9d65aca7dd6604c98af9e03e88b36e6cce2852cdcddf6f", "ja": "海美ちゃんは、育ちゃんのお姉さまになったのだから\n……『お姉さま』って呼ばなくちゃ。ね？", "zh": "海美已经成为育的小姐姐了，\n所以……必须叫她“姐姐大人”才行喔。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "089a3bd4ba57c1cdd0d4ea188b0ee479518a93555ea611b2ccf2cdd40e7922e9", "ja": "あ！　……そ、そっか。\nそれじゃあ、えっと……海美お姉さま……？", "zh": "啊！……这、这样啊。\n那，那个……海美姐姐大人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2006_029umi", "source_sha256": "2044b639693f73401b2b53633fd0eda2264e325ddc4fb81526db2df6458e8f28", "ja": "！！！　……お、お姉さまっていうのは、ちょっと……\nお、お姉ちゃんとかでも、良くってよ。", "zh": "！！！　……叫、叫姐姐大人的话，有点太……\n叫、叫姐姐什么的，也是可以的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2007_010azu", "source_sha256": "ce9e9525db48528ee75ba5cd9f4e845a7cf1b91e8b1e433f637183af08894417", "ja": "あら、それはダメよ。\nちゃんと『お姉さま』でなくちゃ。", "zh": "哎呀，那可不行哦。\n必须得好好叫“姐姐大人”才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2008_029umi", "source_sha256": "a733c78280e21aedfce9f19d0dfb8c2856773434f20776e9f982baa90865759a", "ja": "え？　ど、どうしてですか？", "zh": "诶？为、为什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2009_010azu", "source_sha256": "7fa127c8408c8a9da45be1945937316ea4e17f88f3e95ab86d5dde3b151a818c", "ja": "育ちゃんに『お姉ちゃん』って\n呼ばれていいのは、私だけだもの。", "zh": "能让育叫“姐姐”的，\n只有我一个人就够了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2010_010azu", "source_sha256": "1c93ebb2ad6c31721d80ec662c63d41a53179d610eb36efef491ddb4332a7152", "ja": "だから海美ちゃんも、私のことは『あずさお姉ちゃん』\nって呼んでいいのよ？　小さいころみたいにね♪", "zh": "所以海美也可以叫我“梓姐姐”\n哦？就像小时候那样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2011_029umi", "source_sha256": "5ea689e54d6b179703be877f7ec25754d454839ac02c4936712fa80ea2497e00", "ja": "えーっ！？　……じ、じゃあ、その……\nあ、あずさお姉、ちゃん……。", "zh": "诶——！？……那、那……\n梓、梓姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2012_010azu", "source_sha256": "18507c59cf25ec46fea6cc88e76d9f29ef838cb5e2bc6ead355c397e5e0282b4", "ja": "うふふ、うれしいわ。\nまるで昔に戻ったみたい……♪", "zh": "呵呵呵，我好高兴呀。\n感觉就像回到了从前一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2013_029umi", "source_sha256": "9cd0bdbc44e771d0344a1af75d2c8b68571d698818108b63afcd2fbccdc6f0f0", "ja": "……ね、ねえ、育。あずさお姉ちゃんって、\nちょっと変わってるよね……？", "zh": "……那、那个，育。梓姐姐她，\n感觉有点特别呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2014_030iku", "source_sha256": "1c12eab808992df9b6db845391ae9cccc5195f80ac84b2960a437d1bc340db92", "ja": "うん……。\nわたしもそう思う……。", "zh": "嗯……\n我也这么觉得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2015_010azu", "source_sha256": "fb0dd933e73831aa32882a632d99eba5492c4ef6c0116eed687c625eee5db8e7", "ja": "まあ、ふたりで内緒話？\nずるいわ、私も混ぜてくれなくちゃ……。", "zh": "哎呀，你们两个在说悄悄话吗？\n真狡猾，也得算我一个才行呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_13_2016_101kot", "source_sha256": "14bd8fc1d6dbe60709f428700199d2b790b82b39a41bf92d81a8bbcaf25fe7a3", "ja": "学び舎で気品を育み、庭園にて優美に歌う。ここは\n乙女たちが日々を謳歌する『聖ミリオン女学園』……", "zh": "在学堂中培养品格，于庭园里优雅歌唱。这里是少女们每日尽情享受青春的『圣百万女学园』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
